      <description sparkle:format="markdown">## 更新内容

- 改善画面文字广告扫描：已有部分广告区间时继续补全识别，减少遗漏。
- 同步同版视频的扫描完成状态，减少已经完成识别的视频重复扫描。

需要 macOS 12.0 或更高版本。请按 Mac 芯片选择 Apple Silicon 或 Intel 安装包。

## What’s New

- Improved on-screen ad scanning to keep looking for missing intervals when some ad timings are already available.
- Added synchronization of scan completion for the same video version to reduce repeated scanning.

Requires macOS 12.0 or later. Choose the Apple Silicon or Intel download for your Mac.
</description>
